{"steam_appid":3799100,"steam_name":"SIDE EFFECTS","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3799100/1020721639/3ced0263319dc1856ab70c29eed74e93ac29b677/1763374465/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763737264","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257233206/260cd6dd404fa23f091413893278d13f68550ac5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763737264","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/a848fefec09a697fdd6afcb0a41737b11282e893/ss_a848fefec09a697fdd6afcb0a41737b11282e893.1920x1080.jpg?t=1763737405","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/d275cd6c9b3c45bfa609d0c5a37583338a3b85ae/ss_d275cd6c9b3c45bfa609d0c5a37583338a3b85ae.1920x1080.jpg?t=1763737405","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/25e6a40013f074b12cf566deae9efa94eaa8a21a/ss_25e6a40013f074b12cf566deae9efa94eaa8a21a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1763737405","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/60a1b09a0d8b68b62f94e71c6624f352747b56f9/ss_60a1b09a0d8b68b62f94e71c6624f352747b56f9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1763737405","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/7a062105b495bb5f2e9be410582d4546e95a1943/ss_7a062105b495bb5f2e9be410582d4546e95a1943.1920x1080.jpg?t=1763737405"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Up to four test subjects. One twisted medical trial. Only one leaves.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/extras/d5a99df562c21b52b3dbf7d93676886a.poster.avif?t=1763737405\" width=1170 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/extras/d5a99df562c21b52b3dbf7d93676886a.webm?t=1763737405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/extras/d5a99df562c21b52b3dbf7d93676886a.mp4?t=1763737405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Side Effects: a tense, turn-based medical roulette game. Each round you'll be presented with a selection of pills. Some are helpful, some are harmful, and some mean instant death. You never know what you're about to consume or what it might do to your mind or body. Winning means outlasting – AKA, outliving – your opponent across the table. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/extras/a9dd7b9c005812d98283269c9cc1dfb2.poster.avif?t=1763737405\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/extras/a9dd7b9c005812d98283269c9cc1dfb2.webm?t=1763737405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/extras/a9dd7b9c005812d98283269c9cc1dfb2.mp4?t=1763737405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every pill impacts your resistance. Manage it wisely: zero resistance means death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experiment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Between rounds, you can choose from a range of experimental items and treatments that can shift the odds in your favor, from vaccines to mouth clamps. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You’re not alone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The other patient wants to outlast you. They’ll bluff, adapt, and use everything at their disposal to keep breathing one dose longer than you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Would you like to participate?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/extras/96b38f8bf284290a016847c3013fa0a6.poster.avif?t=1763737405\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/extras/96b38f8bf284290a016847c3013fa0a6.webm?t=1763737405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799100/extras/96b38f8bf284290a016847c3013fa0a6.mp4?t=1763737405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This trial includes: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single player mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multiplayer mode <i>(2-4 Players)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ unique items </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 pill types to test</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Relatively modern dedicted graphics card (Vulkan support required)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Vulkan support required</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Relatively modern dedicted graphics card (Vulkan support required)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Vulkan support required</li></ul>","genres":["Indie","Strategy"],"developers":["hirohun","Mr.Pootsley","Jaybooty","Lofar42"],"publishers":["Free Lives"],"release_date":"21 Nov, 2025"}